stories-prison-alert-level-green-announcement = All clear, no threats observed. Inmates are permitted to move without handcuffs within prison territory.
stories-prison-alert-level-blue-announcement = Possible escape attempt detected! Inmates must gather in the main hall for roll call.
stories-prison-alert-level-violet-announcement = Attention! Unauthorized intrusion detected in prison airspace or the prison station itself.
stories-prison-alert-level-yellow-announcement = Power failure, atmospheric anomaly, or external structural damage to the prison station.
stories-prison-alert-level-red-announcement = Prison escape or assault on prison staff! Inmates must remain in their cells during suppression.
stories-prison-alert-level-gamma-announcement = Large-scale riot or martial law declared in prison! Inmates must remain in cells. Lethal force authorized for insubordination.
stories-prison-alert-level-delta-announcement = Prison self-destruct protocols activated.
